flowchart TD
    A[/rdapq task or resume/] --> D{User depth switch?}
    D -- yes --> E[lean / standard / full]
    D -- no --> F[Fallback from effort and risk]
    E --> G[Load included phase only]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Implement]
    H --> I[Verify with a real command]
    I --> J{Hard gate and oracle Q}
    J -- new failing oracle, round < 3 --> H
    J -- same oracle twice --> K[STALLED]
    J -- round cap, no command --> L[MISSING_TEST]
    J -- round cap, unclear done --> M[UNCLEAR_TASK]
    J -- gates pass and Q measured --> N[Checkpoint state]
    N --> O[COMPLETE]
